n, we attempt to write each option in the standard form.\n\nA first-order linear ODE is in standard form if it is written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+P(x)y=Q(x).\n$$\n\nNote that the option\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)={x}^{2}\n$$\n\ncannot be written in standard form since the power of $y$ in the term $\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)$ is not $1.$ Since the equation cannot be written in standard form, we conclude that it is not a first-order linear ODE.\n\nAll of the other equations can be written in the standard form, and therefore they are first-order linear ODEs." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036933/state.json" "file_sha256" "82d26ec01c7dfb334e8f651cca3271269c8f6d609c3cfc997aa82576b9e73b82"} {"question" "q-103559" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036933/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1546f0e9b1bf06bff40e7bfc86b9a5dacb385ae508daadb1ff3ece564edf5238"} {"question" "q-103559" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14036933/state.json" "file_sha256" "82d26ec01c7dfb334e8f651cca3271269c8f6d609c3cfc997aa82576b9e73b82"} {"question" "q-103559" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-{x}^{2}y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x"] ["math" "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x)y={x}^{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+4y={e}^{x}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xy)={x}^{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-xy=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choi